    "BETA NOTICE: This assistant is in beta testing. There may be malfunctions, bugs, issues, or inaccurate responses. By using it, you agree to our Terms of Use and Privacy Policy.\n\nEach company handles your messages under its own terms and privacy policy, and bills your key for what you use.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BETA NOTICE: This assistant is in beta testing. There may be malfunctions, bugs, issues, or inaccurate responses. By using it, you agree to our Terms of Use and Privacy Policy.\n\nEach company handles your messages under its own terms and privacy policy, and bills your key for what you use."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AVISO BETA: Este asistente está en pruebas beta. Puede haber fallos, errores, problemas o respuestas inexactas. Al usarlo, aceptas nuestros Términos de uso y nuestra Política de privacidad.\n\nCada empresa procesa tus mensajes bajo sus propios términos y política de privacidad, y cobra a tu clave lo que uses."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BETA NOTICE: This assistant is in beta testing. There may be malfunctions, bugs, issues, or inaccurate responses. By using it, you agree to our Terms of Use and Privacy Policy.\n\nGoogle keeps requests for up to 55 days, only to check for misuse, and doesn’t use them to train its models.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BETA NOTICE: This assistant is in beta testing. There may be malfunctions, bugs, issues, or inaccurate responses. By using it, you agree to our Terms of Use and Privacy Policy.\n\nGoogle keeps requests for up to 55 days, only to check for misuse, and doesn’t use them to train its models."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AVISO DE BETA: Este asistente está en pruebas beta. Puede haber fallos, errores, problemas o respuestas inexactas. Al usarlo, aceptas nuestros Términos de uso y Política de privacidad.\n\nGoogle guarda las solicitudes hasta 55 días, solo para detectar usos indebidos, y no las usa para entrenar sus modelos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
