    "Nothing will be billed. A $0 invoice reads as paid, and paid invoices can’t be edited or deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se cobrará nada. Una factura de $0 figura como pagada, y las facturas pagadas no se pueden editar ni eliminar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing would be billed for this job. Check the discount if you meant a smaller number.": {
      "localizations": {
