        }
      }
    },
    "That change didn’t save": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese cambio no se guardó"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That code didn’t match or has expired. Try again, or send a new one.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That code didn’t match or has expired. Try again, or send a new one."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese código no coincide o ya caducó. Intenta de nuevo o envía uno nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That code didn’t work. It may have expired — send a new one and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese código no funcionó. Puede haber caducado: envía uno nuevo e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That document couldn’t be made.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se pudo crear ese documento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file couldn’t be opened. Try a different file, or export it as a PDF first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se pudo abrir ese archivo. Prueba con otro archivo o expórtalo primero como PDF."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file is over 25 MB, so it can’t be backed up.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That file is over 25 MB, so it can’t be backed up."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese archivo pesa más de 25 MB, así que no se puede respaldar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file is too large to back up. Files must be under 25 MB.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese archivo es demasiado grande para respaldarse. Los archivos deben pesar menos de 25 MB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That isn’t part of your work schedule.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eso no forma parte de tu horario de trabajo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That job belongs to a different customer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese trabajo pertenece a otro cliente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That name is too long to fit on a signature line. Try a shorter version — a first initial and last name works well.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese nombre es demasiado largo para la línea de firma. Prueba una versión más corta: la inicial del nombre y el apellido funcionan bien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That one is only done on its own screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eso solo se hace en su propia pantalla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That photo couldn’t be opened — it may be in a format we can’t read, or it didn’t finish downloading from iCloud. Please try a different one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se pudo abrir esa foto: puede estar en un formato que no podemos leer, o no terminó de descargarse de iCloud. Prueba con otra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That photo couldn’t be turned into a signature. Try a clearer picture of your signature on plain paper.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se pudo convertir esa foto en una firma. Prueba con una foto más clara de tu firma sobre papel en blanco."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That photo is too large for a signature. Try a closer photo of just your signature.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That photo is too large for a signature. Try a closer photo of just your signature."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esa foto es demasiado grande para una firma. Prueba con una foto más de cerca de solo tu firma."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That project belongs to a different customer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese proyecto pertenece a otro cliente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That record isn’t here anymore. It may have been deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese registro ya no está aquí. Es posible que se haya eliminado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That status change didn't stick. Reopen the record and set it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese cambio de estado no se aplicó. Vuelve a abrir el registro y defínelo otra vez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That tax document couldn't be backed up. Your other changes were saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese documento fiscal no se pudo respaldar. Tus demás cambios sí se guardaron."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That tax document couldn't be opened on this device. The copy on your other device is unaffected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese documento fiscal no se pudo abrir en este dispositivo. La copia en tu otro dispositivo no se ve afectada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That tax document needs a newer version of My Business. Update the app to back it up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese documento fiscal necesita una versión más reciente de My Business. Actualiza la app para respaldarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That took too long — ask me again.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eso tardó demasiado — vuelve a preguntarme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That value can only be set once and can't be changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese valor solo se puede definir una vez y no se puede cambiar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That was too much to look up at once.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eso fue demasiado para buscar de una sola vez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s more than the %@ balance due, but Stripe already collected it. Saving keeps the full amount on record so your books match the Stripe payout.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es más que el saldo pendiente de %@, pero Stripe ya lo cobró. Al guardar, el monto completo queda registrado para que tus libros coincidan con el depósito de Stripe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s more than the %@ balance due. Enter the balance due or less.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es más que el saldo pendiente de %@. Ingresa el saldo pendiente o menos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s more than the balance due. Enter the balance due or less.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eso es más que el saldo pendiente. Escribe el saldo pendiente o menos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s too much to look up offline — try a narrower question.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es demasiado para buscar sin conexión — prueba con una pregunta más específica."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The App Store isn’t offering this subscription at the moment. Please try again later.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El App Store no está ofreciendo esta suscripción en este momento. Intenta de nuevo más tarde."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Jobs tab": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La pestaña de Trabajos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app can’t do that from here.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La app no puede hacer eso desde aquí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app couldn’t open that just now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La app no pudo abrir eso en este momento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app couldn’t use this device’s storage, so changes won’t be kept after you close it. Restarting the device usually fixes this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La app no pudo usar el almacenamiento de este dispositivo, así que los cambios no se conservarán al cerrarla. Reiniciar el dispositivo suele solucionarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant comes with Pro + AI.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El asistente viene con Pro + AI."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant couldn’t answer just now. Try again.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El asistente no pudo responder en este momento. Intenta de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant is paused for now. Try again later.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El asistente está en pausa por ahora. Intenta más tarde."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant isn’t available right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El asistente no está disponible en este momento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant needs a connection right now.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El asistente necesita conexión en este momento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant now works with your prices, rates, and quantities exactly as you entered them — no rounding.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El asistente ahora usa tus precios, tarifas y cantidades tal como los escribiste, sin redondear."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant sends what you type and the records it needs to Google’s Gemini, a paid service, through Gold Life’s server, to answer. Stop sharing and it asks again the next time you use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El asistente envía lo que escribes y los registros que necesita a Gemini de Google, un servicio de pago, a través del servidor de Gold Life, para responder. Si dejas de compartir, te preguntará de nuevo la próxima vez que lo uses."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant sends what you type and the records it needs to the AI companies you connect (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google or Meta), straight from this device with your own key, to answer. Stop sharing and it asks again the next time you use it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The assistant sends what you type and the records it needs to the AI companies you connect (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google or Meta), straight from this device with your own key, to answer. Stop sharing and it asks again the next time you use it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El asistente envía lo que escribes y los registros que necesita a las empresas de IA que conectas (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google o Meta), directo desde este dispositivo con tu propia clave, para responder. Si dejas de compartir, te preguntará de nuevo la próxima vez que lo uses."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant sends what you type or say, and the records it needs to answer, to %@.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El asistente envía lo que escribes o dices, y los registros que necesita para responder, a %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant shows how much of this month’s AI you’ve used and when it renews — right under the conversation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El asistente muestra cuánto de la IA de este mes has usado y cuándo se renueva, justo debajo de la conversación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant took too long to answer. Try again.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El asistente tardó demasiado en responder. Intenta de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant will ask before it sends anything again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El asistente preguntará antes de enviar algo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection dropped. Try again.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se cortó la conexión. Intenta de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection timed out before Stripe answered. Check your connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se agotó el tiempo de espera antes de que Stripe respondiera. Revisa tu conexión e intenta de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection timed out before sign-in finished. Check your connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se agotó el tiempo de espera antes de terminar el inicio de sesión. Revisa tu conexión e intenta de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The delete didn’t finish": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The delete didn’t finish"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La eliminación no terminó"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The delete didn’t finish — %@ still has your data. Check your connection and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La eliminación no terminó — %@ todavía tiene tus datos. Revisa tu conexión e intenta de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The delete didn’t finish — you’re still signed in. Check your connection and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La eliminación no terminó — sigues con la sesión iniciada. Revisa tu conexión e intenta de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The email addresses and phone numbers your one-time sign-in codes can be sent to.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los correos y números de teléfono a los que se pueden enviar tus códigos de un solo uso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The end date can’t be before the start date.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La fecha de término no puede ser antes de la fecha de inicio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The full legal name of the person signing and authorizing this contract.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El nombre legal completo de la persona que firma y autoriza este contrato."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The job site or property address where work is performed. When different from billing, this will auto-fill into new estimates and contracts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La dirección del lugar de trabajo o propiedad donde se realiza el trabajo. Cuando sea diferente a la de facturación, se completará automáticamente en nuevos presupuestos y contratos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The package is built around the Certificate of Liability Insurance your insurer issued with %@ named as the certificate holder. Upload it once, here, and you can send their full package.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El paquete se basa en el Certificado de Seguro de Responsabilidad Civil que tu aseguradora emitió con %@ como titular del certificado. Súbelo una vez, aquí, y podrás enviar su paquete completo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pay it covered goes back to owed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El pago que cubría vuelve a quedar pendiente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pay it covered goes back to owed. This can’t be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El pago que cubría vuelve a quedar pendiente. Esto no se puede deshacer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The payments already recorded cover the new total, so the invoice will read paid. Paid invoices can’t be edited or deleted. If the customer paid more than the new total, the invoice shows the credit due.": {
      "extractionState": "migrated",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The payments already recorded cover the new total, so the invoice will read paid. Paid invoices can’t be edited or deleted. If the customer paid more than the new total, the invoice shows the credit due."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los pagos ya registrados cubren el nuevo total, así que la factura figurará como pagada. Las facturas pagadas no se pueden editar ni eliminar. Si el cliente pagó más que el nuevo total, la factura muestra el crédito a favor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved copy on this device couldn’t be read, so it was reset. Your backed-up business data re-downloads from your Gold Life account, but changes this device hadn’t backed up yet may be missing.": {
