    "With Save API Key off, your key stays in memory for this sign-in session only and is wiped when you sign out. All chat completions connect directly from this device to %@. Gold Life never sees, proxies, logs, or charges for your AI usage.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
