    "Your API key is encrypted in your iCloud Keychain, scoped to your Gold Life ID so it syncs across your Apple devices and Gold Life apps. All chat completions connect directly from this device to %@. Gold Life never sees, proxies, logs, or charges for your AI usage.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your API key is encrypted in your iCloud Keychain, scoped to your Gold Life ID so it syncs across your Apple devices and Gold Life apps. All chat completions connect directly from this device to %@. Gold Life never sees, proxies, logs, or charges for your AI usage."
          }
        },
